35
00:01:42,440 --> 00:01:45,500
Prop forty-two could also prevent Prop forty’s wealth tax

36
00:01:45,500 --> 00:01:48,640
from taking effect if both pass and forty-two gets

37
00:01:48,640 --> 00:01:49,860
more yes votes.

38
00:01:50,580 --> 00:01:53,880
The conflict and its legal interpretation matter alongside the

39
00:01:53,880 --> 00:01:54,920
broader restrictions.

40
00:01:56,080 --> 00:02:00,160
A voter might favor predictable rules for savings, investments,

41
00:02:00,160 --> 00:02:03,940
and business assets, or object to taxes that reach

42
00:02:03,940 --> 00:02:04,360
