45
00:02:08,480 --> 00:02:11,280
This is a choice about limiting government’s future taxing

46
00:02:11,340 --> 00:02:11,740
authority.

47
00:02:13,380 --> 00:02:16,000
You might want future voters to retain more tax

48
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:16,600
choices.

49
00:02:17,240 --> 00:02:20,520
Another voter could prefer deciding future tax proposals individually

50
00:02:20,520 --> 00:02:23,020
